## Reviewer points not applied
- Dropping "1" from "1 godinu" / "1 godine" / "jedno lice". The digit is in the Korean source. A missing number fails the checker. The glued style stays.
- Promoting Q16–Q20 to headings, and deleting U+200B padding. Same structure and the same ZWSP counts as the Korean source. Removing them fails `blocks` or `headings`.
- Naming the flno=3 link as a different article. The Korean label counts 제10조, so the visible number stays 10. The URL was not edited. The flno=3 vs "article 10" mismatch is in the Korean source.
- Deleting the 008 row "Težina za poslodavca". That would drop a table row. The header was shortened instead.
- Reformatting "TWD 1.57M", and editing the Hangul `url` values. Both are standing skip rules.
- sr-b 11's problem line says "Braking margin, not time." The English source says the motorcycle "had too little time to brake", and the suggested Serbian rewrite is about time. The time wording was applied. The problem line does not match the English.
- 007 "mesnom pravu" was left. That is the private-international-law term for the law of the place, not a neighborhood authority and not the abolished "mesni sud".
